Hi <%= @user.username %>,

A passkey named "<%= @passkey.nickname %>" was added to your vglist account on <%= @passkey.created_at.utc.strftime('%B %-d, %Y at %H:%M UTC') %>. It can be used to sign in instead of your password.

If this was you, there's nothing else to do.

If it wasn't, change your password and remove the passkey in your account settings:
<%= @settings_url %>
